| Master candidate record | Manuscript/core ID | Study |
|---:|---:|---|
| 83 | 68 | State Contamination in Memory-Augmented LLM Agents |
| 84 | 69 | ADAM: A Systematic Data Extraction Attack on Agent Memory via Adaptive Querying |
