Use the master record when joining to `data/source/literature_corpus.csv` or `screening_tracker.csv`. Use the manuscript/core ID when joining to `core_studies.csv`, the attack/defence matrices, or Appendix A. The machine-readable mapping is `data/processed/id_crosswalk.csv`.
